{"unit_id":"huuthuan-nguyen__dsh-tgrep#card-zh","repo":"huuthuan-nguyen/dsh-tgrep","commit":"35bc7cbac3a57632970248b4318c23e517b6abe4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tgrep 用 Microsoft tgrep 替换 DSH 内置 grep，为代码库提供三元组索引搜索，并在工作区管理可复用的索引守护进程。它保留 pattern、路径和文件 glob 搜索，支持忽略大小写与结果上限，并按文件分组返回匹配行，也能在索引未就绪时退回扫描，并显示守护进程启动状态提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:746-785","index.js:844-917"]}
{"unit_id":"huuthuan-nguyen__dsh-tgrep#card-en","repo":"huuthuan-nguyen/dsh-tgrep","commit":"35bc7cbac3a57632970248b4318c23e517b6abe4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tgrep replaces DSH's built-in grep with Microsoft tgrep for trigram-indexed code search and manages a reusable workspace index daemon. It keeps pattern, path, and file-glob searches, supports case-insensitive matching and result limits, and returns matching lines grouped by file.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:746-785","index.js:844-917"]}
