{"unit_id":"huuthuan-nguyen__dsh-tgrep#feature-1","repo":"huuthuan-nguyen/dsh-tgrep","commit":"35bc7cbac3a57632970248b4318c23e517b6abe4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tgrep 的功能「索引代码搜索」：在 DSH 调用 grep 工具时，将正则或文本模式交给 tgrep 搜索工作区，可按路径和文件 glob 限定范围，并把匹配行按文件分组返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:746-785","index.js:844-917","index.js:1056-1069"]}
{"unit_id":"huuthuan-nguyen__dsh-tgrep#feature-2","repo":"huuthuan-nguyen/dsh-tgrep","commit":"35bc7cbac3a57632970248b4318c23e517b6abe4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tgrep 的功能「自动索引守护进程」：首次搜索时可为当前工作区启动 tgrep serve，后续搜索复用索引；启动未就绪时搜索仍继续扫描，并显示守护进程状态提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:283-367","index.js:869-914"]}
{"unit_id":"huuthuan-nguyen__dsh-tgrep#feature-3","repo":"huuthuan-nguyen/dsh-tgrep","commit":"35bc7cbac3a57632970248b4318c23e517b6abe4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tgrep 的功能「搜索结果卡片」：搜索完成后把匹配文件、行号和预览整理为 DSH 搜索卡片元数据，并在结果过多时截短展示内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:664-692","index.js:720-819"]}
{"unit_id":"huuthuan-nguyen__dsh-tgrep#feature-4","repo":"huuthuan-nguyen/dsh-tgrep","commit":"35bc7cbac3a57632970248b4318c23e517b6abe4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tgrep 的功能「守护进程回收」：对插件自己启动的工作区服务，在会话退出时按配置停止，也可在搜索空闲达到设定时限后停止，避免服务持续运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:149-185","index.js:226-265","index.js:528-548"]}
{"unit_id":"huuthuan-nguyen__dsh-tgrep#caveat-1","repo":"huuthuan-nguyen/dsh-tgrep","commit":"35bc7cbac3a57632970248b4318c23e517b6abe4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tgrep 使用前须知：运行搜索需要本机 PATH 中有 Microsoft tgrep；插件会尝试启动工作区守护进程并将日志写入 .tgrep/serve.log（见 index.js:9-10、301-323）。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:9-10","index.js:301-323"]}
